## 1. Data Collection & Ownership

We believe your personal schedule and daily habits are strictly confidential.

* **Your Data Stays With You**: All reminder records, tags, priority levels, checklist items, and notification schedules reside strictly on your local device filesystem.
* **No Remote Databases**: We do not maintain cloud servers that store your personal reminders.
* **No Monetization of Personal Data**: We never sell, rent, lease, or monetize your tasks, notes, or schedule.
* **User Autonomy**: You have complete control to create, modify, export, or permanently delete your records at any time.

---

## 2. Android System Permissions

To ensure your alarms trigger reliably on time and notifications reach you without delays, the app requests specific system capabilities:

| Permission | Technical Name | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| **Exact Alarm Scheduling** | `SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM` | Guarantees exact-to-the-minute alarm triggers via Android `AlarmManager`. |
| **Full-Screen Wake-up Alarm** | `USE_FULL_SCREEN_INTENT` | Displays the full-screen wake-up alarm interface over lock screens. |
| **Notifications** | `POST_NOTIFICATIONS` | Delivers push alerts and actionable heads-up reminder notifications. |
| **Boot Completed** | `RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED` | Reschedules active alarms automatically after device reboots so you never miss a task. |
| **Vibration** | `VIBRATE` | Provides haptic feedback and vibration alerts during alarms. |

> [!NOTE]
> All requested permissions are executed **strictly on-device** and are never used to transmit personal data to external servers.

---

## 3. Subscriptions & Google Play In-App Billing

Reminder offers optional Pro upgrades (Monthly and Yearly subscriptions) providing an ad-free experience and unlimited active reminders.

* **Secured Exclusively by Google**: All financial processing and billing operations are conducted through **Google Play In-App Billing (Billing Client 9.x)**.
* **No Financial Data Handled**: We never view, collect, store, or process your credit card numbers, bank details, or billing addresses.
* **Real-time Verification**: Active subscriptions are validated directly against your authenticated Google Play account.
* **Management & Cancellation**: You can modify or cancel your subscription at any time directly through the Google Play Store app settings.

---

## 4. Advertising & Diagnostic Telemetry

To support ongoing development and maintenance of the free tier, the app integrates certified third-party service providers:

* **Google AdMob**: Displays banner ads and app open ads in the free tier. AdMob may utilize anonymous advertising identifiers in strict compliance with Google’s Advertising Policies.
* **Firebase Crashlytics & Analytics**: Aggregates anonymous crash stack traces, device model names, OS versions, and high-level interaction flows to detect memory leaks, prevent ANRs, and ensure optimal battery performance.

> [!TIP]
> **Ad-Free Experience**: Subscribing to **Reminder Pro** permanently eliminates all advertisements and disables tracking SDKs during your active session.

---

## 5. Backup, Export & Data Deletion

Your data belongs entirely to you. Through the built-in **Backup & Restore** feature, you have complete freedom to:

1. **Export**: Generate an unencrypted, standardized JSON file containing all active tasks, subtasks, categories, and schedules to your local device storage or personal cloud drive (Google Drive, Dropbox, etc.).
2. **Restore**: Perform a Smart Merge or Full Restore on new devices without third-party intervention.
3. **Data Deletion**: Permanently wipe all records simply by clearing app storage in Android System Settings or by uninstalling the application.

---

## 6. Children's Privacy

Reminder is safe for general audiences and adheres to COPPA (Children's Online Privacy Protection Act) and GDPR standards. We do not knowingly collect or solicit personal information from children under the age of 13.

